  <data key="d7">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d8">mixed</data>
  <data key="d9">Mechanistic interpretation attributed to operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy combined with density functional theory calculations.</data>
  <data key="d10">["claim_pt_tunes_her_mechanism"]</data>
